  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "lnd_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -324
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Parallax valley\n\nA day in a mountain valley. Five ridges (noise along a line, closed into polygons) slide past at different speeds, nearer ones faster — parallax — and each is mixed toward the sky's horizon colour by its distance, so far ridges fade into the air (atmospheric perspective), with fog bands between them. The sun and moon cross on an arc; the sky gradient, the ridge colours and the stars all follow the sun's height. Birds are the Simulation node's flocking boids, tiny.\n\n• Slider into `tod`: the time of day (with the toggle off).  • Toggle: let the day run by itself (a minute a day).\n• Slider into `speed`: how fast you travel.  • Move the mouse sideways: look around (parallax).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 260
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Parallax valley\n\nA day in a mountain valley. Five ridges (noise along a line, closed into polygons) slide past at different speeds, nearer ones faster — parallax — and each is mixed toward the sky's horizon colour by its distance, so far ridges fade into the air (atmospheric perspective), with fog bands between them. The sun and moon cross on an arc; the sky gradient, the ridge colours and the stars all follow the sun's height. Birds are the Simulation node's flocking boids, tiny.\n\n• Slider into `tod`: the time of day (with the toggle off).  • Toggle: let the day run by itself (a minute a day).\n• Slider into `speed`: how fast you travel.  • Move the mouse sideways: look around (parallax).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 260
      }
    },
